{"session_id": "20260907T061852Z-24ab00", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T06:21:13+00:00", "language": "ta", "input_mode": "voice", "query": "Sugarcane farming subsidy, where to get it, those kinds of details are a bit difficult.", "translated_query": "Central Government sugarcane farming subsidy details where to apply", "answer": "The TECHNOLOGY MISSION ON SUGARCANE DEVELOPMENT provides subsidy assistance for sugarcane cultivation. To get this, you must apply to the DDH / ADH concerned with your ID proof, land details, and bank account details. The AHO of your Block will verify your eligibility and land suitability, and a Gardner, HEW, or HO will identify you. The maximum subsidy is Rs. 58,000 per hectare, which is 40% of the total cultivation cost of Rs. 1,45,000. For more details, ask about the TECHNOLOGY MISSION ON SUGARCANE DEVELOPMENT scheme.", "citations": [{"chunk_id": "schemes::0890", "doc_id": "schemes", "scheme_name": null, "source_type": "pdf", "source_path": "D:\\ai\\GenAIArchitect\\Buildathon05092026\\data\\raw\\SCHEMES.pdf", "source_url": null, "page_number": 192, "rerank_score": 0.8456837128586578}, {"chunk_id": "schemes::0916", "doc_id": "schemes", "scheme_name": "Rashtriya Krishi Vikas Yojana", "source_type": "pdf", "source_path": "D:\\ai\\GenAIArchitect\\Buildathon05092026\\data\\raw\\SCHEMES.pdf", "source_url": null, "page_number": 197, "rerank_score": 0.6041987996000476}, {"chunk_id": "schemes::0278", "doc_id": "schemes", "scheme_name": null, "source_type": "pdf", "source_path": "D:\\ai\\GenAIArchitect\\Buildathon05092026\\data\\raw\\SCHEMES.pdf", "source_url": null, "page_number": 57, "rerank_score": 0.23030438666655972}, {"chunk_id": "tnau-paddy-schemes::0065", "doc_id": "tnau-paddy-schemes", "scheme_name": "Integrated Pest Management", "source_type": "html", "source_path": "D:\\ai\\GenAIArchitect\\Buildathon05092026\\data\\raw\\tnau-paddy-schemes.htm", "source_url": null, "page_number": null, "rerank_score": 0.07787462873260616}, {"chunk_id": "schem